From dfa165481aa91c48b60f8f8d25b11b7b0cc4ac68 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Jul 2026 05:48:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Redesign owner app: Inspection tab, TrustScore visibility,
 fleet activity stats
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Give the owner app a fourth tab, Inspection, between Activity and
  Rental: per-driver rental-health standing plus their latest weekly
  inspection (health score + photo thumbnails), replacing the old
  RentalHealthFleetRow list on the Rental tab.
- Rental tab now shows what an owner actually needs per driver: TrustScore
  ring, rental-term payment progress (week N of 52 as a percentage), and
  on-time payment reliability — the owner previously had no visibility
  into a driver's TrustScore at all.
- Driver detail screen gains the same TrustScore + reliability breakdown
  near the top, so drilling into a driver shows the full picture.
- Activity tab now reports fleet-wide today/week/month km and driving
  hours via a new useOwnerFleetDistanceTotals hook, with a per-driver
  weekly breakdown when the owner has more than one driver.
- Apply the nude/cardGreen design tokens to Home/Activity/Inspection/
  Rental for visual consistency with the driver app.
